{"id": "dev021", "question": "Workflow受理信号是哪帧？", "split": "dev", "type": "fact_single", "unanswerable_category": null, "edition": null, "expected_route": "SINGLE", "gold_docs": ["api-reference/guides/streaming"], "nuggets": [{"text": "首个data事件workflow_started表示Workflow运行已受理。", "importance": "vital"}, {"text": "第一帧ping只表示连接保活。", "importance": "okay"}], "persona": "novice", "phrasing": "natural_short", "premise": "indirect", "lexical": "similar", "behavior_group": "single", "behavior_subtype": "short", "guessable_without_docs": null, "gold_doc_groups": [["api-reference/guides/streaming"]], "reference_answer": "应等到首个data事件workflow_started。第一帧ping只用于保活，不能当作业务受理信号。", "most_likely_failure": "把HTTP连接或ping当成运行已受理。"}
{"id": "dev022", "question": "不重跑前面的步骤，怎么换一份中间结果只测后面的步骤？", "split": "dev", "type": "fact_single", "unanswerable_category": null, "edition": null, "expected_route": "SINGLE", "gold_docs": ["self-host/use-dify/debug/variable-inspect"], "nuggets": [{"text": "在变量检查器中编辑可修改的中间变量值。", "importance": "vital"}, {"text": "单独运行下游节点时会使用编辑后的值，无需重跑上游。", "importance": "vital"}], "persona": "novice", "phrasing": "natural_short", "premise": "indirect", "lexical": "distant", "behavior_group": "single", "behavior_subtype": "synonym", "guessable_without_docs": null, "gold_doc_groups": [["self-host/use-dify/debug/variable-inspect"]], "reference_answer": "在底部变量检查器中编辑可修改的中间变量值，再单独运行下游节点；下游用改后的值，不必重跑前面的步骤。", "most_likely_failure": "只会全流程重跑或修改节点配置。"}
{"id": "dev023", "question": "外部知识检索请求体的顶层必填字段有哪些？", "split": "dev", "type": "fact_single", "unanswerable_category": null, "edition": null, "expected_route": "SINGLE", "gold_docs": ["self-host/use-dify/knowledge/external-knowledge-api"], "nuggets": [{"text": "顶层必填字段包括knowledge_id。", "importance": "vital"}, {"text": "顶层必填字段包括query。", "importance": "vital"}, {"text": "顶层必填字段包括retrieval_setting。", "importance": "vital"}], "persona": "novice", "phrasing": "natural_short", "premise": "indirect", "lexical": "similar", "behavior_group": "single", "behavior_subtype": "numeric_table", "guessable_without_docs": null, "gold_doc_groups": [["self-host/use-dify/knowledge/external-knowledge-api", "cloud/use-dify/knowledge/external-knowledge-api"]], "reference_answer": "顶层必填字段有knowledge_id、query、retrieval_setting。嵌套参数不算顶层字段。", "most_likely_failure": "把top_k等嵌套参数误列为顶层字段。"}
{"id": "dev024", "question": "一批独立输入逐项处理，失败后要占位续跑，怎么配？", "split": "dev", "type": "fact_single", "unanswerable_category": null, "edition": null, "expected_route": "SINGLE", "gold_docs": ["self-host/use-dify/nodes/iteration"], "nuggets": [{"text": "采用迭代节点的“错误时继续”处理策略。", "importance": "vital"}, {"text": "失败元素的结果用null占位。", "importance": "okay"}], "persona": "novice", "phrasing": "natural_short", "premise": "indirect", "lexical": "distant", "behavior_group": "single", "behavior_subtype": "neighbor", "guessable_without_docs": null, "gold_doc_groups": [["self-host/use-dify/nodes/iteration"]], "reference_answer": "用迭代节点，错误处理选“错误时继续”；失败项保留null占位，其余项继续。", "most_likely_failure": "把循环当独立数组处理，或误选移除失败结果。"}
{"id": "dev025", "question": "云版知识库存储按什么计量、满额还能编辑分段吗、删文档后为何额度没立刻降？", "split": "dev", "type": "summary", "unanswerable_category": null, "edition": "cloud", "expected_route": "MULTI", "gold_docs": ["cloud/use-dify/knowledge/knowledge-storage-limit"], "nuggets": [{"text": "存储用量取决于文档产生的向量数量。", "importance": "vital"}, {"text": "额度满时，编辑分段会被拦截。", "importance": "vital"}, {"text": "删除后账单用量数字延迟刷新。", "importance": "vital"}], "persona": "novice", "phrasing": "natural_short", "premise": "indirect", "lexical": "similar", "behavior_group": "multi", "behavior_subtype": "scattered_ordered", "guessable_without_docs": null, "gold_doc_groups": [["cloud/use-dify/knowledge/knowledge-storage-limit"]], "reference_answer": "按文档产生的向量数量计量。满额会拦截编辑分段。删文档后账单用量延迟刷新，资料没有给出固定刷新秒数。", "most_likely_failure": "按文件体积算用量或凭数字未降就断言删除无效。"}
{"id": "dev026", "question": "启动Dify1.17.1前，Weaviate逐级升级时，备份用什么复制选项、总量用哪种查询、失败回退时数据卷怎么办？", "split": "dev", "type": "summary", "unanswerable_category": null, "edition": null, "expected_route": "MULTI", "gold_docs": ["self-host/deploy/troubleshooting/weaviate-server-migration-path"], "nuggets": [{"text": "离线复制备份数据卷时使用cp -a。", "importance": "vital"}, {"text": "对象总量使用GraphQL的Aggregate查询。", "importance": "vital"}, {"text": "失败回退时还原初始备份的数据卷。", "importance": "vital"}], "persona": "expert", "phrasing": "natural_long", "premise": "indirect", "lexical": "similar", "behavior_group": "multi", "behavior_subtype": "scattered_ordered", "guessable_without_docs": null, "gold_doc_groups": [["self-host/deploy/troubleshooting/weaviate-server-migration-path"]], "reference_answer": "离线备份用cp -a保留数据卷属性；总对象数用GraphQL Aggregate查询，不用分页接口的totalResults。中途失败回退时，除回退镜像外，还必须还原初始数据卷备份，不能让旧镜像直接读新版本写过的卷。", "most_likely_failure": "备份丢权限、拿分页大小当总量，或只退镜像不还原卷。"}
{"id": "dev027", "question": "自建Dify邮件助理第8课里，检索后是什么、上线前哪些内置凭据要换？", "split": "dev", "type": "reasoning", "unanswerable_category": null, "edition": null, "expected_route": "MULTI", "gold_docs": ["learn/tutorials/workflow-101/lesson-08", "self-host/use-dify/nodes/agent"], "nuggets": [{"text": "检索后接Product Support Agent，即新Agent节点。", "importance": "vital"}, {"text": "生产前需替换的凭据集合是DIFY_AGENT_SERVER_SECRET_KEY和DIFY_AGENT_API_TOKEN。", "importance": "vital"}], "persona": "novice", "phrasing": "natural_short", "premise": "indirect", "lexical": "similar", "behavior_group": "multi", "behavior_subtype": "chain", "guessable_without_docs": null, "gold_doc_groups": [["learn/tutorials/workflow-101/lesson-08"], ["self-host/use-dify/nodes/agent"]], "reference_answer": "第8课在知识检索后接Product Support Agent，使用从空白开始的新Agent。其节点说明要求生产使用前，把DIFY_AGENT_SERVER_SECRET_KEY和DIFY_AGENT_API_TOKEN换成自己的随机值。", "most_likely_failure": "只停在课程摘要，或查到经典Agent配置而遗漏新Agent运行时凭据。"}
{"id": "dev028", "question": "停止对话为何可能成功却没停，工作流日志接口能给逐节点记录吗？", "split": "dev", "type": "reasoning", "unanswerable_category": null, "edition": null, "expected_route": "MULTI", "gold_docs": ["api-reference/guides/end-user-identity", "api-reference/guides/workflow"], "nuggets": [{"text": "停止接口user不匹配时会被静默忽略。", "importance": "vital"}, {"text": "工作流日志接口只返回运行级汇总，不提供逐节点执行日志。", "importance": "vital"}], "persona": "novice", "phrasing": "natural_short", "premise": "indirect", "lexical": "similar", "behavior_group": "multi", "behavior_subtype": "parallel_compare", "guessable_without_docs": null, "gold_doc_groups": [["api-reference/guides/end-user-identity"], ["api-reference/guides/workflow"]], "reference_answer": "停止时的user若与发起回复时不一致，操作会被静默忽略，虽返回成功也没停。工作流日志接口给运行级汇总，不是逐节点日志。", "most_likely_failure": "把成功响应等同停止生效，或把运行级汇总当逐节点追踪。"}
{"id": "dev029", "question": "按语义分流和按字段规则分流，分别选什么节点？", "split": "dev", "type": "reasoning", "unanswerable_category": null, "edition": null, "expected_route": "MULTI", "gold_docs": ["self-host/use-dify/nodes/question-classifier", "self-host/use-dify/nodes/ifelse"], "nuggets": [{"text": "按输入语义判断分类应选问题分类器。", "importance": "vital"}, {"text": "按预定义变量条件判断分支应选If-Else。", "importance": "vital"}], "persona": "novice", "phrasing": "natural_short", "premise": "indirect", "lexical": "similar", "behavior_group": "multi", "behavior_subtype": "parallel_compare", "guessable_without_docs": null, "gold_doc_groups": [["self-host/use-dify/nodes/question-classifier"], ["self-host/use-dify/nodes/ifelse"]], "reference_answer": "语义分类选问题分类器，由大语言模型理解输入并挑选分类；明确字段或变量的比较规则选If-Else。", "most_likely_failure": "混淆模型语义分类与确定性的条件比较。"}
{"id": "dev030", "question": "Sandbox与社区版建即用型知识库时，批量文件数和单文件大小各上限多少？", "split": "dev", "type": "reasoning", "unanswerable_category": null, "edition": null, "expected_route": "MULTI", "gold_docs": ["cloud/use-dify/knowledge/create-knowledge/import-text-data/readme", "self-host/use-dify/knowledge/create-knowledge/import-text-data/readme"], "nuggets": [{"text": "Sandbox单次上传上限为1个文件。", "importance": "vital"}, {"text": "Sandbox单文件大小上限为15 MB。", "importance": "vital"}, {"text": "社区版默认单次上传上限为5个文件。", "importance": "vital"}, {"text": "社区版默认单文件大小上限为15 MB。", "importance": "vital"}], "persona": "novice", "phrasing": "natural_short", "premise": "indirect", "lexical": "similar", "behavior_group": "multi", "behavior_subtype": "parallel_compare", "guessable_without_docs": null, "gold_doc_groups": [["cloud/use-dify/knowledge/create-knowledge/import-text-data/readme"], ["self-host/use-dify/knowledge/create-knowledge/import-text-data/readme"]], "reference_answer": "Sandbox：每批最多1个文件、单个最大15 MB。社区版默认：每批最多5个文件、单个最大15 MB；社区版可通过相应环境变量调整，故这里报文档默认值。", "most_likely_failure": "把云版付费套餐50个/50 MB套给Sandbox，或混用社区默认值。"}
